     "id": 1174786,
     "content_html": "a loss of economic support from important allies"
    },
    {
     "id": 1174788,
     "content_html": "a 40 percent increase in gas prices"
    },
    {
     "id": 1174785,
     "content_html": "the end of its alliance with Israel"
    }
